<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ERPM says still in talks, cautions holders.</title>
<headline>ERPM says still in talks, cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Rand Proprietary Mines Ltd said on Thursday talks regarding the possible restructuring of the mine had not produced constructive results.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a short statement and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
